The following commit has been merged into the locking/core branch of tip:

Commit-ID:     ec4fad7c2bdc80c62fa73f799b77ad299f73dcc3
Gitweb:        https://git.kernel.org/tip/ec4fad7c2bdc80c62fa73f799b77ad299f73dcc3
